{
  "id": "get-started-see-alerting",
  "title": "See an alert rule",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "**What you will learn:** An alert rule is a question asked on a schedule, with a line that must not be crossed. You'll see alerts that are firing right now, then open one rule to see the question and the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "First, see alerts that are firing:"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "find-a-rule",
      "title": "See what's firing",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/alerting/alerts",
          "verify": "on-page:/alerting/alerts",
          "objectives": ["on-page:/alerting/alerts"],
          "content": "Open **Alert activity**. This page lists alerts that have crossed their line. Play already filters it to **Firing**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "doIt": false,
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid triage groups-container']",
          "content": "Each row is an alert firing right now, grouped in folders. **Demo: Alerting** is Play's demo set.",
          "tooltip": "Grafana is watching these rules, and each one has already crossed its line.",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/alerts", "exists-reftarget"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You saw alerts in action: firing means the line was crossed, and **Alert activity** is where you look."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Next, open one rule to see why it can fire:"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "read-the-rule",
      "title": "Read the rule",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/alerting/grafana/random-single-serie/view",
          "verify": "on-page:/alerting/grafana/random-single-serie",
          "objectives": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/random-single-serie"],
          "content": "Open **Random Single Serie** to see the question and the line."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "doIt": false,
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='queries-container']",
          "content": "This is the question: a query the rule asks on a schedule, with the answer drawn as a chart.",
          "tooltip": "Grafana asks this on the rule's schedule, whether or not anyone is looking.",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/random-single-serie", "exists-reftarget"]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "doIt": false,
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='expressions-container']",
          "content": "This is the line: the **alert condition**. When the answer crosses it, the rule fires and a notification goes out.",
          "tooltip": "The threshold that turns a number into a decision: above the line means fire, below means stay quiet.",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/alerting/grafana/random-single-serie", "exists-reftarget"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "**What you have learned:** Firing alerts show up on **Alert activity**. A rule is a question plus a line: a query asked on a schedule, and a condition that decides when to fire. Grafana keeps watch so you don't have to."
    }
  ]
}
